      "translation": {
        "english_text": "(She looks at the letter.) Maniballava, O king! A woman or war! Your consent is required.\nGopativarman.\nAh! What a valiant warning. Father! Write the reply—War! Write `War`.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The letter wording and signature are source-owned inside this immutable dialogue record, so they remain inside the same translation unit."
        ]
      }
    },
