      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Enough—the trouble brought by your own tongue! The chick's fault has fallen upon the hen's head.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source proverb-like chicken/chick image is kept rather than replaced by a different English proverb."
